WEBVTT

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:04.750
Well, then... 'night, Ais.

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.540
See you tomorrow.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.210
Yes... Good night.

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.080
Good night.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:12.790
Oh, Lefiya...

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.580
Thanks... for the clothes.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:21.040
No, thank YOU for helping me the other day!

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:57.540
I am... Ganesha!

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:02.290
Seeing so many of my colleagues at this party tonight,

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:04.380
I, Ganesha, am filled with the deepest gratitude!

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:06.710
Now THIS is a party...

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.670
I don't see that Shrimp around, though. She chicken out?

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.330
Oh, if it isn't Loki!

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:19.330
Hey! Dionysus, Demeter! Didn't see ya there!

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.960
Yes. It's been too long, Loki.

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:24.920
This is a banquet of the GODS, after all.

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:27.830
So how has your Familia been getting on recently?

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:32.500
You know, not a day goes by that I don't hear
some rumor or another about your children.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.920
Well, ya know... They're doin' all right.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.420
How 'bout yours?

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.170
We're still so puny.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:42.580
It's all we can do to keep our heads above water.

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.250
As if!

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.330
Wow, this wine's amazing!

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:52.330
You think so? It was made from
the grapes harvested by my Familia.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:55.670
Huh, never woulda guessed! First-rate stuff!

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:00.290
The food and wine are of the finest quality...
It appears they've put in quite the effort.

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:02.130
Without your cooperation,

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:02.580
Oh, right. Guess it's already that time of year, huh?
Without your cooperation,

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:04.290
Oh, right. Guess it's already that time of year, huh?
a smooth, orderly Monsterphilia festival would not be possible!

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:04.750
a smooth, orderly Monsterphilia festival would not be possible!

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.330
From the beginning, the purpose of this banquet
a smooth, orderly Monsterphilia festival would not be possible!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:06.460
was to lay the groundwork to ensure
that no accidents arise at the festival.
a smooth, orderly Monsterphilia festival would not be possible!

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:09.170
was to lay the groundwork to ensure
that no accidents arise at the festival.
I beg your assistance!

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:11.170
was to lay the groundwork to ensure
that no accidents arise at the festival.
I, Ganesha, ask this of you!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:16.330
It doesn't matter if you're the Guild or Ganesha himself...
if the other Familia don't agree,

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:21.130
something as whimsical as bringing monsters to the
surface for a bit of spectacle just wouldn't be possible.

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:23.040
True...

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:26.920
Speaking of which, will you be attending
the Monsterphilia, Loki?

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.830
Well, it IS a festival after all...

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:36.170
Sorry, Dionysus, Demeter! I've gotta run!

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.920
Of course. Until next time.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.170
See you, Loki.

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:42.630
Hey! Freya! And you, Shrimp!

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:45.920
You have another wicked scheme up your sleeve?

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.880
What ever makes you say that?

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:53.960
Well, whenever you get that look in your eye,
it means something big is going to happen.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.170
Brilliant slash, Miss Ais!

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.040
I suppose it wasn't enough for you break a sweat.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.920
No, but thank you.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.960
I'm still not used to this blade...

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:20.290
It feels like it'll break if I use my full strength.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:24.330
It's a little sad when compared
to your unbreakable blade, Desperate.

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:29.080
But it's only a loaner, so breaking it
would just cost you more money.

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:35.130
I'm sorry, for dragging you here as my Support, Lefiya.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:40.080
Oh, it's no trouble at all!
I'm happy you brought me along.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:48.210
If only I were able to do Concurrent Chanting,
then I could be of more use to you.

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:50.630
That thing Riveria does a lot?

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:55.210
Yes! It's when you chant while fighting a monster.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.000
It doesn't require you to remain in one place,

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:02.250
so you can fight without
needing to be protected by someone...

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:08.000
But I only learned to concentrate
on my magic just recently, so...

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.210
Lefiya!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:19.630
Are you hurt?

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:23.960
I-I'm fine. Thank you.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:30.130
What's that?

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.210
The Ganesha Familia...

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:37.000
Oh, they're getting ready for Monsterphilia!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.210
That's right, it's tomorrow, isn't it?

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:44.380
So THAT'S how they bring
the captured monsters to the surface...

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:52.130
U-um... Miss Ais...

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:58.880
Would you... like to go with me? To Monsterphilia?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.580
Sure, I'll go.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.040
Thank you!

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:13.960
It sure got dark quickly.

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:15.000
Shh...

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.290
Where have you been?

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:24.040
We've only just returned from the expedition...

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:26.960
Would it hurt you to let your body rest for a day?

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.920
And you even took Lefiya with you...

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:31.880
I'm sorry.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:36.210
I-it's not her fault! I begged her to take me along!

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:38.710
Even so, you need to be more aware of yourselves.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:42.670
Oh! What are you all up to in the middle o' the night?

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.080
As you can see, I'm lecturing these two.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.920
Sure is tough bein' you, Mama.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:49.500
Who are you calling "Mama"?

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:54.880
In that case, maybe it's time for me to use my
goddess authority for once and dish out a punishment.

00:06:55.420 --> 00:07:01.330
Ais, you're comin' with me
to Monsterphilia tomorrow as my escort.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:02.790
Your escort?

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:06.540
B-but wait! Miss Ais already said she would go with me!

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:11.500
Sorry Lefiya, but I got my reasons. No refusals allowed!

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:12.670
Whaaat?

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:15.460
Understood.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.170
'Kay, all set then!

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.420
A date, a date!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:30.670
Just when I thought I'd be able
to go to Monsterphilia with Miss Ais...

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:41.790
Eatin red pepper matcha hlavor
potato poppers wih you is da best, Lehiya!

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.210
Dis is henhational!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:47.540
Oh my... I'm sure it's only because
YOU'RE the best, Miss Ais.

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:50.040
Here, try a bite.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:56.540
W-w-would that mean...
an indirect something-something...?!

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.080
I was hoping that would happen!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.330
Miss Ais...!

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:07.290
Lefiya, I can't sleep,
so could you stop with the crying now?

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.790
Just a lil' more...

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:14.500
I know that now isn't the time to be crying about it.

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:19.710
A small fry like you wouldn't suit Ais Wallenstein!

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:25.960
I can't just keep counting on others to rescue me.
I need to get better at fighting.

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:28.960
I need to... have more courage...

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:37.000
...or I'll never be allowed to stand by her side.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:46.540
Ais! You're going to Monsterphilia with LOKI?! Why?!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.290
It's my punishment.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.250
It's my punishment...

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:54.670
No way! I thought the four of us could all go together!

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.630
There's no use groaning about it.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:59.880
Ais, if we meet up later,
let's take a walk around the food stalls.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.380
Sure. Lefiya?

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:07.790
Today... I'll be wearing that outfit.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.500
Okay!

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:15.420
There's somethin' I been thinkin' about lately, you know.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:17.540
So I called up a certain goddess.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:21.580
Well, you might call it an emergency meeting,
or somethin' proper like that.

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.790
That's why you wanted an escort...

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.540
Exactly.

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:29.630
Yo! Sorry we're late!

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.790
It's... Lady Freya...

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.880
What're you plottin' this time?

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:50.830
You making a pass at some other Familia's kid
that's caught your interest?

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:55.630
Damn, you just love sowin' those seeds of discord,
don'cha? You perverted goddess!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:58.290
Oh dear, I do try to be discrete, you know.

00:09:58.420 --> 00:09:59.290
Out with it!

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:02.330
You're gonna take responsibility for this, right?

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:04.040
Of course.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:08.790
Although, I may need you to
play along with me for a little while...

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.500
Pfft, you never change, do ya...

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:16.500
So? What's he like then? This kid you're after.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:18.630
He's not strong...

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.460
Finding him was truly a coincidence.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.130
He just crossed into my sight for a moment.

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:29.290
What's the matter?

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:31.540
I apologize. I've some urgent business to attend to.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.880
Huh? How come all of a sudden-

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:35.920
We'll meet again.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.080
What's gotten into her?

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.580
And she left us the damn bill, too!

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.040
Hey Mister! One sauce flavored and...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.790
One azuki cream flavored.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:51.420
You got it!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:55.170
One sauce and one azuki cream!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.250
Hey, Ais. Say "ahhh"!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.000
No.
Hey, Ais. Say "ahhh"!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.580
Wha-? Why not?! Let's split it!

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:03.250
No.

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:07.960
Come on, it's my dream to see ya
do that "ahhh" thing, Ais! Please?

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:08.710
No.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:12.710
W-well then, I'LL say "ahhh" and you feed me!

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:16.040
One "ahhh", then I promise I'll give up.

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:18.540
'Kay? That's fine, right? Right?!

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:32.380
An indirect kiss with Ais!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.630
What, you don't want to eat something I had a bite of?

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:41.080
No, it's not that. I can't take a goddess' portion!

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:44.710
I guess I'm not the only one with problems like this.

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.750
And now, the event you've all been waiting for!

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:57.170
The Ganesha Familia monster tamers,
the stars of Monsterphilia, will now begin the Taming!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:11.460
You'll do perfectly.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:20.080
Man, lookin' around all those food stalls
really took a chunk outta our time.

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:22.500
The Monster Taming will have started already.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:25.330
Not that I'm dyin' to watch it or anything.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:26.290
Huh?

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:28.000
They're from the Guild...

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:31.750
What's up? This some kinda get-rich-quick scheme?

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:33.670
Has something happened?

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:38.630
Lady Ais Wallenstein...

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:44.540
Amazing! These tamers
really know what they're doing!

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.170
H-huh?

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:51.250
Do you think something's gone wrong?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.670
Looks like it.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.880
We should go make sure it's all right.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:57.790
Loki!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.830
Ah, fancy seein' you here!

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.130
What's going on?

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:06.630
To put it simply... We've got monsters
runnin' wild in the streets!

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:08.250
What?! Seriously?!

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:10.170
I-isn't that bad?!

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:12.170
Yep, pretty darn bad.

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:14.630
Now's not the time to feign composure!

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:17.830
Do you have any idea how many people
are gathered around this area today?!

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.290
That's why I had HER take care of it.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.830
Ais.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.420
There you are...

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:33.460
Tempest.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:07.790
Miss Ais is incredible!

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.330
At this rate, we won't even get a turn to fight.

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:12.210
Shall we leave it to Ais today, then?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:16.830
I think so. We didn't even bring
our weapons or anything...

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:22.920
What is that? A snake?!

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:24.540
I've never seen anything like that before.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:27.830
Where the hell did those Ganesha guys find THIS thing?!

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.880
We need to attack, Tiona!

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.380
Lefiya, start chanting!

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:32.380
R-right!

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:41.830
Gods, that's hard!

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:44.170
What the hell is this stupid thing?!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:45.630
If only we'd brought our weapons!

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:48.290
These are city streets...

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:53.000
With a simple chant, I can reduce my power output
and still be able to react quickly in battle...

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:58.790
Unleash a streak of light, bow and arrow of the holy tree.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:01.250
Thou art a master of the bow.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:04.040
Fire, O elven archer.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.000
May your arrow strike true!

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.500
It's reacting to my magic!

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:13.750
Lefiya!

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.540
Lefiya!

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:25.420
That's no snake! It's a flower?!

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:31.130
These stupid things are in my way!

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.380
Lefiya, get up! Get up!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:36.830
No...

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:41.630
No... No! I'm doing it again...!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.250
Lefiya!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:49.250
I know... she'll come and rescue me again...

00:15:58.670 --> 00:15:59.670
Ais!

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:03.920
Wha-? There's MORE?!

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:04.750
Three of them?!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.170
He's going to be mad at me...

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:27.830
Ais, that thing can sense magic! Get rid of your wind!

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:31.500
Weapons or no weapons, if we each take on one of 'em
we'll figure something out!

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:52.830
Miss Ais...!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:56.290
Don't try to move yet. You need a medic.

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:59.290
Help from the Ganesha Familia
should be arriving at any moment!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:09.210
Just idolizing her... always being rescued...

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:14.830
I need to have... courage!

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:17.670
My name...

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:20.540
My name is Lefiya Viridis!

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.500
An Elf of the Wishe Forest!

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.540
I am bound to the Goddess Loki,

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:32.040
and a member of the strongest, proudest,
grandest Familia in all of Orario!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:35.460
I refuse to run and hide!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:41.420
I know that... I'll only get in her way!

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:45.290
Up until now, and hereafter...

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.920
No matter how much I chase her,
I know I'll never catch up...

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.880
I don't even deserve to stand next to her...

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:59.290
But, I want to catch up! I want to help her! Support her!

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.790
I want to fight alongside her!

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:06.380
I call upon the name of Wishe.

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:12.330
If all I can do is chase after her,
then I've no choice but to continue on!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:16.920
Ancestors of the forest, my proud brethren.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:20.500
Answer my call and come to the plains!

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:24.170
Bonds connected, the pledge of paradise.

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:26.830
Spin the wheel and dance!

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:30.040
Come, ring of the elves.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:32.750
Please, lend me your strength!

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:34.710
Elf Ring!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:36.460
Lefiya!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:43.630
Harbinger of the end, white snow, swirl and twist before the twilight.

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:44.880
Isn't that-

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:46.330
A Summon Burst!

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:52.420
It's a rare magic that only Lefiya can use- it allows her
to duplicate an infinite number of other spells!

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.880
That's why she was given the alias...

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:00.790
Thousand Elf.

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:05.250
Darkening light... frozen earth.

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:07.460
I'm not afraid...

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:09.380
I'm not afraid!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:13.830
There's someone I need to catch up to!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:18.000
Storm of snow, three bitter winters...

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:21.250
My name is Alf! Wynn Fimbulvetr!

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:41.830
Thanks, Lefiya! You saved us all!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.290
Miss Tiona...

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:45.750
That was some impressive magic.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:48.460
You were just like Riveria back there...

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:51.580
Thank you, Lefiya.

00:19:52.380 --> 00:19:55.290
It's n-nothing...

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.630
Nice work, everybody.

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:58.750
Loki.

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:01.290
Your work's not done yet!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.330
Ais, take care of the stragglers who ran away, wouldja?

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:09.710
Tione and Tiona, sorry,
but couldja check out the sewers?

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.000
We'll be in trouble if any more of 'em are down there.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.290
Got it.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:17.830
Lefiya, don't overdo it now.
Have the Guild medics fix ya up.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:21.790
I'm gonna go find this kid's parents. See ya 'round!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:24.130
Sorry, Lefiya...

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:25.000
What?

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:28.250
The clothes... they're completely ruined...

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:32.460
We can go buy some more sometime!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.920
You drink the rest of this.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:41.290
Huh? A-are you sure?

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:45.000
G-good luck out there!

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:51.130
It's an i-indirect something-something...

00:20:55.000 --> 00:21:00.920
It's not as if anything has changed.
This changed nothing.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:03.500
But...

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:07.920
I know now that I can start to change!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:11.000
Really...

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:16.000
Didja need somethin' that colossal just to meddle
with some kid you've got your eye on?

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:19.210
Well now, I thought you agreed to play along with me?

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.920
Besides, no harm was done in the end, right?

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:28.380
Right. All those monsters ragin' through the city streets
and hardly anybody got hurt or killed.

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:31.330
Only one who got a lil' banged up was our Lefiya.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:32.630
She was wounded?

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:37.420
Yep. By that big, nasty snake-flower-lookin' thing...

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:39.710
The twins said it was some kinda new species, but...

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:44.580
Didja really make your goo-goo eyes
at a foul thing like that? That's just too gross!

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:46.630
What are you talking about?

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:50.330
There weren't any monsters who looked like that
among the ones I released.

00:21:50.630 --> 00:21:51.790
Wha-?

00:21:51.960 --> 00:21:54.080
Then where'd it come from?

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:55.330
Who knows?

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.250
A storm is brewing...

00:23:37.630 --> 00:23:39.210
"The Murder and the Jewel"
